'''Darkbringer '''is a [[Godly Weapons|godly]] gun that is obtainable by unboxing it from [[Mystery Box 2]] or through trading.

== Appearance==
Unlike most guns, the Darkbringer is not a revolver, although it looks and sounds like one. The whole gun is a pathbringer, but black in color. The handle has a red grip on the underside. The barrel also has two red stripes. There is a "wing" in the center of the gun that is also red in color. The trigger is also red, but the trigger guard is black.

==Trivia ==
*It has a [[Chroma Darkbringer|chroma]] counterpart under the name [[Chroma Darkbringer]], which can be found in the same box.
*It also has an [[Unique Weapons|Unique]] counterpart under the name [[Dartbringer]].
*Like most other [[Season 1]] weapons, it was modeled and textured by [[IDontHaveAUse]].
*It is part of a set with the [[Godly Weapons|godly]] gun [[Lightbringer]], making the [[Murder Mystery 2 Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Bringer Set|Bringer Set]].
*It is also commonly partnered with the [[Ancient Weapons|ancient]] knife [[Batwing]] however, it is not considered a set.
*Unlike most weapons, it is not salvageable in the crafting station.

